/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Leandros%20muttered%20a%20prayer,souls%20to%20the%20Underworld","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Leandros%20muttered%20a%20prayer,souls%20to%20the%20Underworld","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e6","era":null,"summary":"Boulders fall behind the squad, sealing the canyon, and a minotaur horde led by a huge sword-wielding brute charges them.","participants":["leandros","captain-kyrillos","minotaurs"],"location":"one-eyed-pass","importance":"major","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":432,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":85,"quote":"From ahead of them came the sound of savage cries and thundering hooves, and then the first minotaurs rounded the corner.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=From%20ahead%20of%20them,minotaurs%20rounded%20the%20corner.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=From%20ahead%20of%20them,minotaurs%20rounded%20the%20corner.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e8","era":null,"summary":"Mnesos is gutted by a minotaur and is lost behind the hord